  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.serveratelier.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.serveratelier.com/assets/themes/atelier/assets/images/banner/sa_budget.png\" alt=\"今天就在 ServerAtelier 獲取您的平價遊戲伺服器\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xR4YM0ND/RAYs-3D-Ladders/main/gallery/rays_3d_ladders_title_wide.png\" alt=\"rays 3d 梯子 標題橫幅\"></p>\n<p>此資源包會更換 Minecraft 中梯子的方塊與物品材質。<br>\n自 2.0 版本起支援着色器（Shaders）。  </p>\n<p>它本身不會新增任何物品或方塊，而是覆蓋下方所列模組及原版已有的梯子模型。  </p>\n<h2>支援的模組：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/building-but-better\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Building But Better</a> <code>// LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chipped\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chipped</a> <code>// LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> <code>// LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-deco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Deco</a> <code>// LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Fabric</a> <code>// LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/excessive-building\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Excessive Building</a> <code>// 變體 + LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nemos-carpentry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nemo's Carpentry</a> <code>// 變體 + LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nemos-more-ladder-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nemo's More Ladder Variants</a> <code>// 變體 + LabPBR</code></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/speedy-ladders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Speedy Ladders</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fLadder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">原版</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/woodworks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Woodworks</a> <code>// 變體 + LabPBR</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果您需要其他梯子的支援，請告訴我。</p>\n<h2>連結</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/xR4YM0ND/RAYs-3D-Ladders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/source_code-lightgray?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&label= &labelColor=555555\" alt=\"原始碼徽章\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/WXdSYn4yHB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/745451299713056791?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label= &labelColor=555555&color=5865F2\" alt=\"Discord 徽章\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252frays-3d-ladders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/Uupo7yGf?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white&label= &labelColor=555555&color=1BD964\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載數徽章\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/rays-3d-ladders\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/854122?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&label= &labelColor=555555&color=FF8041\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載數徽章\"></a></p>",
